  "title": "VIZSLA SILVER APPOINTS SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT, TECHNICAL SERVICES - Vizsla Silver Corp.",
  "summary": "VANCOUVER, CANADA (May 19, 2026) – Vizsla Silver Corp. (TSX: VZLA) (NYSE: VZLA) (Frankfurt: 0G3) (“Vizsla Silver” or the “Company”) is pleased to announce the appointment of Dave D’Antonio as Senior Vice President of Technical Services for Vizsla Silver, effective immediately. Mr. D’Antonio brings more than 18 years of international mining experience, building and leading high-performance technical teams at large-scale […]",
